#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:86
#: 0b85f66dfd8b429491ffd6f6ac5815aa
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:87
#: a94356cbea204a51abe865f9d9280d54
msgid ""
"The PPM pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"PPM 引脚默认映射到定时器输入，可用于除 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 之外的所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议（这两者需要真正的 "
"UART 连接）。但是，以这种方式连接时，FPort 只能提供 RC 而没有数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:89
#: ec0c40f6ae2a41d4927cc3e0792d9017
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL6 (UART4) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial6."
msgstr ""
"要使用 Fport、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和嵌入式数传，需要使用完整的 UART，例如 "
"SERIAL6（UART4）用于接收机连接。以下是使用 Serial6 的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:91
#: a7a432bdb114485ea8fe3a162bb1c361
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:93
#: d65ac85c12534583be44f30a8b62820c
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:95
#: 4e44eeef4a794990b8ea24f9832d5c5f
msgid ""
"CRSF/ELRS would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF/ELRS 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:97
#: d9f6bbce420541f7ac98b2a8529c7ab8
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the TX pin."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」，并仅连接 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:99
#: 8ad0f2a5029e44ba869b48e5a6c79bdc
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:102
#: 5ac20c86fb614b4ab7b184d0d8c21d41
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:104
#: 9f7ded3b608e498cb01fd265623e4355
msgid ""
"The Pixhawkv6X supports up to 16 PWM outputs. All 16 outputs support all "
"normal PWM output formats. All FMU outputs support DShot, except 7 and 8. "
"These do not support serial LEDS either."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawkv6X 支持最多 16 个 PWM 输出。所有 16 个输出支持所有普通 PWM 输出格式。除 7 和 8 之外的所有 FMU 输出支持 "
"DShot。这些也不支持串行 LED。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:107
#: cc7bf8788d774fc7898311d72ec22c8d
msgid "The 8 FMU PWM outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr "8 个 FMU PWM 输出分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:109
#: d82342c456184698b76d05583b03d73f
msgid "Outputs 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "第 1 组：输出 1、2、3 和 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:110
#: 7e1bd91386294ce389fa2034a0c6b23f
msgid "Outputs 5 and 6 in group2"
msgstr "第 2 组：输出 5 和 6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:111
#: 821c187081004c00b2a4afd9c35d6296
msgid "Outputs 7 and 8 in group3"
msgstr "第 3 组：输出 7 和 8"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:114
#: d178627437194eeaa86a768eb00b790b
msgid ""
"FMU outputs within the same group need to use the same output rate and "
"protocol. If any output in a group uses DShot then all channels in that "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的 FMU 输出需使用相同的输出频率和协议。若某组内任一输出使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

