#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:141
#: 833b3ee2250340d7b6b7083ff9c9e40d
msgid ""
"The Pixhawkv6X has a built-in compass. Due to potential interference, the "
"autopilot is usually used with an external I2C compass as part of a "
"GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr "Pixhawkv6X 内置罗盘。由于潜在的干扰，飞控通常与 GPS/罗盘组合中的外部 I2C 罗盘配合使用。"

